<section>
<title>Detailed Description</title>

<para>Class <link linkend="_class_tpl_app_logs">TplAppLogs</link></para>

<para>This class provides methods to generate and manage the logs menu within the <link linkend="_namespace_bearsampp">Bearsampp</link> application. It includes functionalities for creating the logs menu and listing log files. </para>
