    <title>getMenuLogs()</title>
<indexterm><primary>getMenuLogs</primary><secondary>TplAppLogs</secondary></indexterm>
<indexterm><primary>TplAppLogs</primary><secondary>getMenuLogs</secondary></indexterm>
<para><computeroutput>getMenuLogs ( )<computeroutput>[static]</computeroutput></computeroutput></para>
<para>Generates the logs menu content.</para>

<para>This method retrieves the list of log files from the logs directory, sorts them, and generates menu items for each log file using the getItemNotepad method from the <link linkend="_class_tpl_aestan">TplAestan</link> class.</para>

<para>@global object $bearsamppRoot Provides access to the root directory of the application.</para>

<para><formalpara><title>Returns</title>

<para>string The generated logs menu content as a string. </para>
</formalpara>
</para>
