<para><computeroutput>process ( )<computeroutput>[static]</computeroutput></computeroutput></para>
<para>Processes and generates the logs menu.</para>

<para>This method generates the logs menu by retrieving the localized string for logs and calling the getMenu method from the <link linkend="_class_tpl_app">TplApp</link> class.</para>

<para>@global object $bearsamppLang Provides language support for retrieving language-specific values.</para>

<para><formalpara><title>Returns</title>

<para>array The generated logs menu as a string. </para>
</formalpara>
</para>
